ampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/brazils-hydrolyzed-protein-shampoo-set-1.webp\" alt=\"Shampoo OEM factory\" class=\"wp-image-2550\" srcset=\"https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/brazils-hydrolyzed-protein-shampoo-set-1.webp 800w, https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/brazils-hydrolyzed-protein-shampoo-set-1-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/brazils-hydrolyzed-protein-shampoo-set-1-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/brazils-hydrolyzed-protein-shampoo-set-1-768x768.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" data-id=\"2036\" src=\"https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/organic-keratin-shampoo-and-hair-care-set-5.webp\" alt=\"Shampoo OEM factory\" class=\"wp-image-2036\" srcset=\"https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/organic-keratin-shampoo-and-hair-care-set-5.webp 800w, https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/organic-keratin-shampoo-and-hair-care-set-5-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/organic-keratin-shampoo-and-hair-care-set-5-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/organic-keratin-shampoo-and-hair-care-set-5-768x768.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-i-building-a-diversified-product-line-foundation\">I. Building a Diversified Product Line Foundation<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To achieve flexible customization, shampoo OEM factory must first build a diversified product line foundation. This includes a rich reserve of raw materials, ranging from common surfactants and moisturizers to specialty functional ingredients. Simultaneously, shampoo OEM factory must master various formulation technologies, enabling them to scientifically proportion different raw materials to develop shampoo formulas suitable for various hair types and efficacy needs. Furthermore, diverse packaging formats are also an important part of a diversified product line, including packaging of different sizes, materials, and design styles to meet the needs of clients in different sales scenarios and target audiences.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-ii-optimizing-production-processes-and-management\">II. Optimizing Production Processes and Management<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Efficient and flexible production processes and management are key to achieving customization. <strong>shampoo OEM factory<\/strong> should introduce advanced production equipment and automated control systems to improve production accuracy and efficiency. Through modular production design, we divide the shampoo production process into multiple independent modules, such as raw material mixing, stirring, and filling. We can flexibly combine and adjust each module according to different customization needs. Furthermore, we establish a comprehensive production management system to dynamically adjust production plans and monitor progress in real time, ensuring that production tasks meet customer requirements for both timing and quality standards.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-2 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large has-custom-border\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" data-id=\"2639\" src=\"https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/7-herbs-shampoo-0.webp\" alt=\"Shampoo OEM factory\" class=\"wp-image-2639\" style=\"border-width:1px\" srcset=\"https:\/\/theshampoofactory.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/12\/7-herbs-